# Mosquitto ACL — one block per principal.
# Username == device_id for hardware; the simulator has its own account.
# Keep this file in sync with infra/mosquitto/generate-passwd.sh and the
# seven zone IDs fixed in docs/07-thresholds.md.

# --- Backend subscriber / command publisher -------------------------------
user backend
topic read factory/#
topic write factory/+/+/cmd

# --- Simulator (demo only) ------------------------------------------------
user simulator
topic read factory/+/+/cmd
topic write factory/+/+
topic write factory/+/+/status
topic write factory/+/+/state
topic write factory/+/+/ack

# --- ESP32 devices: write own measurements, status/state/ack; read own cmd -
